## 9. Suggested architecture for another app

### 9.1 Domain modules
Split the logic into these modules:
- `agreement-template service`
- `merchant-agreement service`
- `order service`
- `profit calculation service`
- `analytics projection service`
- `relationship/invite/approval service`

### 9.2 Persistence recommendations
Use separate tables/collections for:
- agreement templates
- merchant agreements
- orders
- approvals
- relationships
- messages/invites

Keep snapshots embedded on orders even if you also normalize upstream tables.

### 9.3 Event recommendations
Useful domain events:
- template_created
- template_versioned
- agreement_created
- agreement_approved
- agreement_rejected
- agreement_archived
- order_created
- order_cancelled
- invite_sent
- invite_accepted
- approval_updated
- message_created

These events help rebuild analytics or sync another app.

